Description: MAVLink companion-computer setup (CM5 + flight controller)
 uavlink installs and configures the MAVLink link between a Raspberry Pi
 CM5 companion computer, the flight controller and a ground station or VPS.
 .
 Installing the package changes nothing on the running system. Run
 "sudo uavlink setup" to open the bilingual (Vietnamese/English) setup page,
 or use the "uavlink" command line tool.
